OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge report leaves council
OL,4,A'extremely concerned'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe issues raised by an independent
OL,7,Freport into the sexual assault of a
OL,8,Fwoman in a Travelodge will be raised by
OL,9,Fan "extremely concerned" council.
OL,11,FThe attack happened in December 2022 at
OL,12,Fthe Maidenhead branch when a man lied
OL,13,Fto hotel staff to obtain a key card for
OL,14,Fthe woman's room in the early hours.
OL,16,FThe report published last week found
OL,17,Fthe Thame-based company failed the
OL,18,Fvictim at every stage of the process
OL,19,Fand guests are still not being kept "as
OL,20,Fsafe as they should be".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
