OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge report leaves council
OL,4,A'extremely concerned'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravelodge previously apologised and
OL,7,Fsaid: "Guest safety remains a top
OL,8,Fpriority and this work will build on
OL,9,Fthe large-scale programme of change."
